# Apps installed through winget on Windows (Git Bash). Counterpart of Brewfile / Aptfile.
# Format: <winget id> | <description> | <on|off = preselected in the install menu>
# Add one from the shell with: dot add <winget id>      (find ids with: winget search <name>)

# Terminal & shell tools
Microsoft.WindowsTerminal | Terminal | on
junegunn.fzf | Fuzzy finder | on
BurntSushi.ripgrep.MSVC | ripgrep | on
sharkdp.fd | fd | on
jqlang.jq | jq | on
ajeetdsouza.zoxide | Smarter cd | on
astral-sh.uv | Python package manager | on

# Git
GitHub.cli | gh | on
JesseDuffield.lazygit | Git TUI | on
Git.Git | Git for Windows | off

# Development
jdx.mise | Language runtime manager (node, elixir, ...) | on
Neovim.Neovim | Editor | on
Anthropic.ClaudeCode | Claude Code | on
Microsoft.VisualStudioCode | Editor | off
Docker.DockerDesktop | Containers | off
Postman.Postman | API client | off
GoLang.Go | Go | off
Python.Python.3.12 | Python 3.12 | off
Google.AndroidStudio | Android builds | off

# Everyday
Google.Chrome | Browser | off
AgileBits.1Password | Passwords | off
AgileBits.1Password.CLI | 1Password CLI (op) | off
Obsidian.Obsidian | Notes | off
Figma.Figma | Design | off
Anthropic.Claude | Claude desktop app | off
